<region region-id="2" left="18.00" top="52.00" width="572.00" height="17.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="62.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Project: D2 I-95 Pedestrian Bridge.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="3" left="18.00" top="75.00" width="572.00" height="43.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="85.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Distilled from the pile design notebook (package 32d46a79afd4), case &quot;End Bent 1 piles: 18 in square prestressed concrete, FBMP fixed run&quot;. Same inputs, equations and load combinations as the notebook; results should match its exported report.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="4" left="18.00" top="124.00" width="572.00" height="43.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="134.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Codes: AASHTO LRFD Bridge Design Specifications, 10th edition (2024): 5.6.4.4, 5.6.4.5, 5.6.6.1, 5.7.3.3, 5.7.3.4.2, 5.9.2.3.2, 5.12.9.4; FDOT Structures Design Guidelines (SDG) 3.5 and Structures Detailing Manual (SDM) 11.4, January 2026; Standard Plans Index 455.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="5" left="18.00" top="173.00" width="572.00" height="30.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="183.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Status: All numerical checks pass (largest ratio 1.00) · 15 pending item(s) remain. Inputs are highlighted yellow; values for the plans are boxed.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="6" left="18.00" top="219.00" width="572.00" height="22.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="234.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Heading 1" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Design basis</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="7" left="18.00" top="247.00" width="572.00" height="160.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="257.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• FBMP source: End Bent 1_Fixed.XML, SHA-256 c1a4afa138865b3f10cc968ce7daef767a4d96e8bc2ccf175c1a5ebd150d912d (registered export EB-XML). 4 piles at 4.5 ft; cutoff elevation 41.2375 ft, ground 24.01 ft.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Pile: Standard Plans Index 455-018 (18 in square), strand pattern 12~0.6, spiral 0.034 in² wire at 6 in.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Downdrag 18 tons per pile is a drag load DR: gamma_DR = 1.1 (strength) and 1 (Service I) in the structural demands (LRFD Table 3.4.1-1, 10.7.3.7); it is excluded from the Factored Design Load and added nominally to the required bearing resistance (SDG Eq. 3-1, phi = 0.75).</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Every worksheet equation is parsed once and evaluated by the generator with unit checking; the build compares each result with the notebook before the file is written. Governing records, the notebook angles and the neutral-axis depth c_gov are inputs read from the notebook.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• The interaction curve is swept live (vectors); the biaxial route of LRFD 5.6.4.5 and the strain-compatibility check about the resultant axis are both evaluated, and the larger ratio governs.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="8" left="18.00" top="425.00" width="572.00" height="22.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="440.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Heading 1" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. Inputs</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="9" left="18.00" top="453.00" width="572.00" height="19.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="465.00" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
