</region>
<region region-id="103" left="18.00" top="1423.60" width="572.00" height="56.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="1433.60" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Governing records of End Bent 1_Fixed.XML for each check (index g). FBMP axial force is converted to compression positive. The drag load DR = DD is added to the axial force at every station (LRFD Table 3.4.1-1, 10.7.3.7): gamma_DR for the limit state of the record. Downdrag is not in the Factored Design Load.</p></text>
</region>
<region region-id="104" left="18.00" top="1485.60" width="572.00" height="82.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="1495.60" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Axial: combo 3 STRENGTH-III · pile 4 · element 10J · EL 24.01 ft.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• 5.6.4.5: combo 2 STRENGTH-III · pile 4 · element 12J · EL 18.60 ft (+1 tied).</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Resultant: combo 2 STRENGTH-III · pile 4 · element 13I · EL 18.60 ft.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Shear: combo 3 STRENGTH-III · pile 4 · element 15I · EL 13.20 ft.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Svc comp.: combo 4 SERVICE-I · pile 4 · element 12J · EL 18.60 ft.</p><p style="List" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">• Svc tens.: combo 4 SERVICE-I · pile 1 · element 1I · EL 41.24 ft (+239 tied).</p></text>
</region>
