</region>
<region region-id="658" left="18.00" top="12871.81" width="572.00" height="43.00" align-x="18.00" align-y="12881.81" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">SDG Eq. 3-1: Rn &gt;= (Factored Design Load + Net Scour Resistance + Downdrag) / phi. The downdrag enters nominally; the minimum tip elevation, scour and test-pile length of the Pile Data Table come from the geotechnical handoff.</p></text>
</region>
